==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{m|la|diēs||day}} and {{m|la|lūnae}}, genitive of {{m|la|lūna||moon}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|diēs Lūnae|eccl=yes}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|diēs Lūnae|diēī Lūnae|f|fifth|head=[[diēs]] [[luna|Lūnae]]}}

# [[Monday]]

